id: specific-form
name: Specific Form
restriction: true
reduction: 5
locked: Vehicle Shift, Weapon Shift
# Its Size chosen here, held to when Shapeshift is used; its 0~2 Bestial Traits are the table's.
choices: nano, tiny, small, medium, large, enormous, gigantic
shapeFixed: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Shapeshift takes only one Size (chosen here) and its chosen Bestial Traits.
text: >
  Specific Form: You are only able to Shapeshift into a specific form.
  –Locked Advancements: Vehicle Shift, Weapon Shift
  –TP Cost: -5
  –Effect: Select a specific Size Category and 0~2 specific Bestial Traits. When you use the Shapeshift Unique Ability,
  you must select that Size Category and any chosen Bestial Traits. You cannot use the Shapeshift Unique Ability if you
  cannot spend enough Actions to apply all of these chosen effects.
